Make a painful strike dealing [122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150% (TL1-5)] weapon damage that increases the duration of up to [1, 2, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5)] negative effect(s) on the target by [2, 3, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns. For each negative effect extended this way, the duration of a beneficial effect is reduced by the same amount, possibly canceling it.
